title: Status
new-page: true
is-special: true
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.updateReich(Q);
window.RF.numbers(Q);
!}

= Status

[+ month : month +] [+ year +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Party funds. Dues bring in one more each month while the party has at least 150,000 members.">Resources</span>!}: [+ funds +]

Members: about [+ members +] thousand

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Where the KPD stands towards the governments of the Reich and the states.">KPD position</span>!}: [+ kpd_position +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="How divided the party is: the anger of each faction, weighted by its size. Details are on the Party tab.">Internal dissent</span>!}: [+ party_dissent : rf_party_dissent +][+ n_party_dissent +]

= Government

Government: [+ government +]

President: <span class="[+ president_class +]">[+ president +]</span> (<span class="p-spd">SPD</span>)

Chancellor: <span class="[+ chancellor_class +]">[+ chancellor +]</span> ([+ chancellor_party +])

[? if emergency != "" : **[+ emergency +]** ?]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Police and courts acting against the party: bans, raids, arrests.">State repression</span>!}: [+ repression : rf_level +][+ n_repression +]

Reichstag, share of seats (elected June 1920):

{!<div id="rf-reichstag"></div>!}

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Reichstag elected in 1920 sits until 1924. Historically it was dissolved in March 1924 and Germany voted on 4 May.">Next election</span>!}: [+ next_election +]

= Economics

Currency: [+ currency +]

[? if dollar_rate != "" : One US dollar: [+ dollar_rate +] ?]

*A full economic model is still to come.*

@party
title: Inside the Party
new-page: true
is-special: true
on-arrival: {!
var RF = window.RF;
Q.overrule_risk = Math.round(100 * RF.overruleChance(Q));
var base = RF.risingBase(Q);
Q.rising_chance = Math.round(100 * Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (base + 30 - 140) / 30)));
var t = Q.year * 12 + Q.month;
// which armed formations the party has: the Proletarian Hundreds of 1923,
// then (from July 1924) the Red Front Fighters' League
if (t < 1923 * 12 + 3) {
    Q.para_stage = 0;
} else if (t < 1923 * 12 + 12 && !Q.party_banned) {
    Q.para_stage = 1;
} else if (t < 1924 * 12 + 7) {
    Q.para_stage = 2;
} else {
    Q.para_stage = 3;
}
Q.hundreds_strength = Math.round(15 + 0.8 * Q.readiness);
Q.rfb_strength = Math.round(40 + Q.readiness);
var next = RF.nextCongress(Q);
Q.next_congress = next ? next.place + ', ' + RF.monthName(next.month) + ' ' + next.year : 'none planned';
RF.numbers(Q);
!}

= Inside the KPD

Leadership: <span class="f-[+ leader +]">[+ leader_name +]</span>

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The leadership only changes at a party congress, where the delegates elect a new Zentrale and Moscow may overturn their choice.">Next party congress</span>!}: [+ next_congress +]

[? if right_expelled = 0 : {!<div class="rf-faction">!}<span class="f-right">Brandler Right</span>{!<div class="rf-stat">!}Strength: [+ right_strength : strength +][+ n_right_strength +]{!</div><div class="rf-stat">!}Dissent: [+ right_dissent : rf_dissent +][+ n_right_dissent +]{!</div>!}{!<div class="rf-bar"><span class="b-right" style="width: !}[+ right_strength +]{!%"></span></div></div>!} ?][? if right_expelled : <span class="f-right">Brandler Right</span>: left the party ?]

[? if center_expelled = 0 : {!<div class="rf-faction">!}<span class="f-center">Middle Group</span>{!<div class="rf-stat">!}Strength: [+ center_strength : strength +][+ n_center_strength +]{!</div><div class="rf-stat">!}Dissent: [+ center_dissent : rf_dissent +][+ n_center_dissent +]{!</div>!}{!<div class="rf-bar"><span class="b-center" style="width: !}[+ center_strength +]{!%"></span></div></div>!} ?][? if center_expelled : <span class="f-center">Middle Group</span>: left the party ?]

[? if left_expelled = 0 : {!<div class="rf-faction">!}<span class="f-left">Fischer–Maslow Left</span>{!<div class="rf-stat">!}Strength: [+ left_strength : strength +][+ n_left_strength +]{!</div><div class="rf-stat">!}Dissent: [+ left_dissent : rf_dissent +][+ n_left_dissent +]{!</div>!}{!<div class="rf-bar"><span class="b-left" style="width: !}[+ left_strength +]{!%"></span></div></div>!} ?][? if left_expelled : <span class="f-left">Fischer–Maslow Left</span>: left the party ?]

[? if ultra_expelled = 0 : {!<div class="rf-faction">!}<span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>{!<div class="rf-stat">!}Strength: [+ ultra_strength : strength +][+ n_ultra_strength +]{!</div><div class="rf-stat">!}Dissent: [+ ultra_dissent : rf_dissent +][+ n_ultra_dissent +]{!</div>!}{!<div class="rf-bar"><span class="b-ultra" style="width: !}[+ ultra_strength +]{!%"></span></div></div>!} ?][? if ultra_expelled : <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>: left the party ?]

[? if stalin_expelled = 0 : {!<div class="rf-faction">!}<span class="f-stalin">Thälmann circle</span>{!<div class="rf-stat">!}Strength: [+ stalin_strength : strength +][+ n_stalin_strength +]{!</div><div class="rf-stat">!}Dissent: [+ stalin_dissent : rf_dissent +][+ n_stalin_dissent +]{!</div>!}{!<div class="rf-bar"><span class="b-stalin" style="width: !}[+ stalin_strength +]{!%"></span></div></div>!} ?][? if stalin_expelled : <span class="f-stalin">Thälmann circle</span>: left the party ?]

= Moscow

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Comintern's strategy for Germany. Factions that fit the line gain standing in Moscow.">Comintern line</span>!}: [? if line == "united_front" : united front with the SPD's workers ?][? if line == "insurrection" : prepare the insurrection ?][? if line == "bolshevization" : Bolshevization of the party ?]

In Moscow: {!<span class="m-zinoviev">Zinoviev</span>!} chairs the {!<span class="p-comintern">Comintern</span>!}[? if year = 1923 : ; {!<span class="m-radek">Radek</span>!} handles Germany. ?][? if year >= 1924 : ; {!<span class="m-radek">Radek</span>!} is blamed for the failed October. ?]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Moscow trusts a party that follows its orders. Low trust means less help and more intervention.">Moscow's trust</span>!}: [+ moscow_trust : relationships +][+ n_moscow_trust +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="How far the KPD still decides for itself. Each intervention from Moscow wears it down, and the lower it is, the easier Moscow overturns a congress.">Party autonomy</span>!}: [+ autonomy : rf_autonomy +][+ n_autonomy +]

Moscow favours: <span class="f-[+ favourite +]">[+ favourite_name +]</span>

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The chance that Moscow overturns the current leadership at the next congress. It grows with the gap between the leadership and Moscow's favourite, and as autonomy falls.">Risk of intervention</span>!}: [+ overrule_risk : rf_overrule +][+ n_overrule_risk +]

= Armed formations

[? if para_stage = 0 : {!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Party stewards who guard meetings and demonstrations.">Ordnerdienst</span>!}: the party's stewards. The Leipzig congress is debating proletarian defence units. ?]

[? if para_stage = 1 : {!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Factory-based workers' defence units, formed from 1923 with SPD and non-party workers. Figures are the party's own claims and uncertain.">Proletarian Hundreds</span>!}: about [+ hundreds_strength +] thousand ?]

[? if para_stage = 1 and month >= 5 : Status: banned in Prussia, legal in Saxony and Thuringia ?][? if para_stage = 1 and month < 5 : Status: legal ?]

[? if para_stage = 2 : {!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Factory-based workers' defence units of 1923.">Proletarian Hundreds</span>!}: dissolved and banned; remnants underground ?]

[? if para_stage = 3 : {!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Red Front Fighters' League, the KPD's uniformed paramilitary, founded in July 1924.">RFB</span>!}: about [+ rfb_strength +] thousand ?]

[? if october_plan : {!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The secret military apparatus built for the German October, with Soviet advisers.">M-Apparat</span>!}: weapons and plans for the rising ?]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Weapons, training and plans for an armed rising.">Armed readiness</span>!}: [+ readiness : rf_level +][+ n_readiness +]

= Support for the revolution

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Hunger, strikes and anger at the Republic. It rises with inflation and falls once the currency is stable.">Revolutionary situation</span>!}: [+ rev_situation : rf_rev +][+ n_rev_situation +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Communist strength in the trade unions and factory councils.">Influence in the unions</span>!}: [+ union_influence : rf_level +][+ n_union_influence +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Whether SPD workers would follow a call to arms. Good relations with the SPD count for a lot.">SPD workers</span>!}: [? if spd_relation >= 60 : might follow ?][? if spd_relation < 60 and spd_relation >= 35 : wary ?][? if spd_relation < 35 : would not follow ?][+ n_spd_relation +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Readiness, the revolutionary situation, the unions, the SPD's workers and state repression, against a Reichswehr and police far stronger than the party.">Chance of a rising</span>!}: [+ rising_chance : rf_odds +][+ n_rising_chance +]

